  "body": "Currently back filling a room during a fast remote join is stalling, while it shouldn't I believe.\r\n\r\nrelevant stacktrace:\r\n```\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/handlers/pagination.py\", line 508, in get_messages\r\n    await self.hs.get_federation_handler().maybe_backfill(\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/logging/opentracing.py\", line 889, in _wrapper\r\n    return await func(*args, **kwargs)  # type: ignore[misc]\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/handlers/federation.py\", line 202, in maybe_backfill\r\n    return await self._maybe_backfill_inner(\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/handlers/federation.py\", line 379, in _maybe_backfill_inner\r\n    filtered_extremities = await filter_events_for_server(\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/visibility.py\", line 650, in filter_events_for_server\r\n    event_to_memberships = await _event_to_memberships(\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/visibility.py\", line 746, in _event_to_memberships\r\n    event_to_state_ids = await storage.state.get_state_ids_for_events(\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/logging/opentracing.py\", line 889, in _wrapper\r\n    return await func(*args, **kwargs)  # type: ignore[misc]\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/logging/opentracing.py\", line 889, in _wrapper\r\n    return await func(*args, **kwargs)  # type: ignore[misc]\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/storage/controllers/state.py\", line 267, in get_state_ids_for_events\r\n    event_to_groups = await self.get_state_group_for_events(\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/logging/opentracing.py\", line 889, in _wrapper\r\n    return await func(*args, **kwargs)  # type: ignore[misc]\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/logging/opentracing.py\", line 889, in _wrapper\r\n    return await func(*args, **kwargs)  # type: ignore[misc]\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/storage/controllers/state.py\", line 374, in get_state_group_for_events\r\n    await self._partial_state_events_tracker.await_full_state(event_ids)\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/logging/opentracing.py\", line 889, in _wrapper\r\n    return await func(*args, **kwargs)  # type: ignore[misc]\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages/synapse/storage/util/partial_state_events_tracker.py\", line 82, in await_full_state\r\n\r\n```",
